## Overall Summary  

2025 was normal-to-dry across the MSEP watershed, with annual total precipitation within 5% of the 30-year average in 4 of the 14 subbasins, and 10-18% lower than normal in the other 8 subbasins. See @fig-precipPctDiff and @fig-mapPrcpAnnualAnoms in particular.    


## Supporting Information  


